			text = [=[Stalvan Mistmantle came from {link:silverpine-forest}Silverpine{/link} and studied under Headmaster Crillian of an academy in {link:stormwind-city}Stormwind{/link}. He became a teacher of children, first at {link:moonbrook}Moonbrook{/link} and then in the house of a noble family, the Flintridges. There he fell in love with his pupil Tilloa. When she chose another, his love turned to hatred. A massacre followed in the Flintridge house, and Stalvan came to live alone in the woods above {link:darkshire}Darkshire{/link}.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Stalvan is the darkest legend of {link:duskwood}Duskwood{/link}. The truth about him lay hidden for years in scattered pages, a lost letter and the memory of an old marshal of {link:stormwind-city}Stormwind{/link}.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
			text = [=[• He ran the new schoolhouse of {link:moonbrook}Moonbrook{/link} and left it when trouble came to {link:westfall}Westfall{/link}.
