			text = [=[The pages tell the tale in his own hand. He wrote of Tilloa's beauty, of a flower she placed in his palm, of a summer at the family cottage near {link:eastvale-logging-camp}Eastvale{/link}. Then he wrote of fury, when she called him a nice old man before her suitor, and of a black void growing within him. The last page promises blood.]=],
